---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import KnowledgeCheck from '../../components/KnowledgeCheck.astro';
import VesselEntry from '../../components/VesselEntry.astro';
import RiskEntry from '../../components/RiskEntry.astro';
import {cargoProfiles} from '../../data/cargo-business.js';
import {mineralUses,mineralRoutes,mineralQuiz} from '../../data/mineral-learning.js';
import '../../styles/vessels.css';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const profiles=mineralUses.map(m=>({...cargoProfiles.find(p=>p.id===m.id),...m}));
---
<Layout title="矿产与干散货" active="cargo" description="从铁矿石、铝土矿、铜精矿、镍矿、煤炭、磷矿石到砂石与石灰石，看懂原料经过港口的业务链。"><div class="container vessel-page"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href={base}>首页</a><Icon name="chevron" size={12}/><a href={base+'cargo/'}>箱型与货类</a><Icon name="chevron" size={12}/><span>矿产与干散货</span></div>
<header class="vessel-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">DRY BULK / 一船原料，怎样接上产业链</span><h1>从一堆矿石，<br/><span>看见一条产业链。</span></h1><p>炼钢的铁矿、炼铝的铝土矿、冶炼用精矿，以及煤炭、磷矿和建材原料：货物散着走，身份、品质、数量和责任仍要跟得上。</p><div class="vessel-hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#mineral-atlas">认识 7 类原料 <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a><a class="text-link" href={base+'vessels/bulk-carrier/'}>先认散货船 →</a></div></div><div class="vessel-hero-board"><span>IRON ORE / 铁矿石业务关系</span><img src={base+'illustrations/cargo/iron-ore.svg'} alt="铁矿石从卸船到堆场和计量的教学示意" width="720" height="360"/><p class="vessel-reference-note">原料用途帮助理解贸易需求，不表示每票货都会进入同一工艺；本页不使用实时进口量或排名。</p></div></header>
<nav class="cargo-local-nav" aria-label="矿产散货目录"><a href="#bulk-logic">先分清</a><a href="#mineral-atlas">货类档案</a><a href="#bulk-chain">船到工厂</a><a href="#outbound">四种疏港方式</a><a href="#bulk-records">数量与品质</a><a href="#bulk-risks">风险与预防</a></nav>
<section class="vessel-section" id="bulk-logic"><span class="eyebrow">01 / KEEP THE DIMENSIONS APART</span><h2>矿产是货物属性，散货是运输形态。</h2><div class="vessel-lenses"><article><h3>干散货</h3><p>不逐件包装，直接进入货舱。业务常围绕船舱、货批、料堆、料流和计量组织，不能照搬箱号与箱位。</p></article><article><h3>件杂货</h3><p>卷钢、成捆木材、机械设备常按件、卷或捆识别。矿产品若袋装、吨袋装或装箱，业务对象和适用规则也会改变。</p></article><article><h3>具体承运条件</h3><p>铁矿石、铁矿粉、精矿等名称需要继续对应实际货物资料与适用规则；不能从“矿物质”三个字推定没有危险。</p></article></div></section>
<section class="vessel-section" id="mineral-atlas"><span class="eyebrow">02 / MATERIAL FILES</span><h2>原料用途不同，港口关注点也不同。</h2><div class="vessel-grid">{profiles.map(p=><a class="vessel-card" href={base+'cargo/'+p.id+'/'}><img src={base+p.visual?.replace(/^\//,'')} alt={p.name+'业务教学线稿'} width="720" height="360" loading="lazy"/><div class="vessel-card-body"><span>{p.use}</span><h3>{p.name} ↗</h3><p>{p.question}</p><small>{p.stages?.length} 个业务节点 · 交接、系统、计量与费用</small></div></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="vessel-section" id="bulk-chain"><span class="eyebrow">03 / FROM HOLD TO RECEIVER</span><h2>实物是一股料流，业务是一串可追溯记录。</h2><div class="mineral-chain">{[['01','船舱与货批','提运单、舱别、货主、品种、货物资料'],['02','卸船与转运','作业计划、船岸确认、卸船设备与输送路径'],['03','堆场与仓储','堆位、批次边界、移位、混配授权与保管'],['04','计量与品质','原始计量、取制样记录、报告与数量口径'],['05','疏港与结算','交付授权、接收回执、库存扣减与服务实绩']].map(([n,title,text])=><article><span>{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="cargo-crosslinks"><a href={base+'knowledge/eq-unloader/'}>卸船机<span>把原料从船舱送出 →</span></a><a href={base+'knowledge/eq-conveyor/'}>皮带输送机<span>让料流到达指定去向 →</span></a><a href={base+'knowledge/eq-stacker/'}>堆取料机<span>把堆位、批次与取料联系起来 →</span></a></div></section>
<section class="vessel-section" id="outbound"><span class="eyebrow">04 / NOT EVERY SHIPMENT PASSES A ROAD GATE</span><h2>货怎样离开港口，校验就跟到哪里。</h2><p>选一种疏港方式，看看同一批货会留下什么记录。以下为业务教学示意，不表示每个港口都具备全部方式。</p><div data-choice-scope class="mineral-routes"><nav class="cargo-choice-nav" aria-label="选择散货疏港方式">{mineralRoutes.map(r=><a href={'#route-'+r.id} data-choice={'route-'+r.id}>{r.name}</a>)}</nav><p class="sr-only" data-choice-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>{mineralRoutes.map(r=><article id={'route-'+r.id} data-choice-panel><span class="eyebrow">OUTBOUND / 交接方式</span><h3>{r.name}</h3><dl><div><dt>哪些记录跟着走</dt><dd>{r.record}</dd></div><div><dt>不能省略的判断</dt><dd>{r.limit}</dd></div></dl></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="vessel-section" id="bulk-records"><span class="eyebrow">05 / THREE RECORDS, THREE QUESTIONS</span><h2>数量对得上，还要知道“按什么算”。</h2><div class="vessel-lenses"><article><h3>数量记录</h3><p>水尺计重、皮带秤和汽车衡有不同的测量对象与边界。比较结果前先看时间、范围、方法和原始记录，不能直接认定差额就是货损。</p></article><article><h3>品质记录</h3><p>品位、含水、粒度和杂质关注的是货物属性。采样对象、代表批次及报告版本需要关联，不用一份报告覆盖后来混入的其他货。</p></article><article><h3>结算记录</h3><p>合同可能关注湿重、干重或其他计价口径；货物货款与港口装卸、堆存等服务费用分开，合同认可口径与实绩共同支持对账。</p></article></div><a class="text-link" href={base+'economics/'}>继续看港口收入、成本与利润 →</a></section>
<KnowledgeCheck quiz={mineralQuiz}/><div id="bulk-risks"><RiskEntry riskIds={['equipment','stack','weather','fire','atmosphere','environment','identity','commercial']}/></div><VesselEntry compact/>
<section class="vessel-section"><h2>资料与范围</h2><p>本页归纳七类货物的学习路线，各货种的专业资料、核查日期和适用范围列在对应业务档案。它不覆盖全部矿种、全部准入要求或所有船舶装运细则，也不据贸易名称判定海运危险性。以中国港口业务为背景说明职责，不假设各港接口、部门或计费项目完全相同。</p></section>
</div></Layout><script>import '../../scripts/cargo-choices';</script>
